{"id":"adff775aa909263a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pblplinearization.md","title":"符号敏感线性化的逐纤维精确性","display":"thm-pblplinearization — 符号敏感线性化的逐纤维精确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pblplinearization","aliases":["27-thm-pblplinearization"],"display":"thm-pblplinearization — 符号敏感线性化的逐纤维精确性","depends_on":["[[27-df-pblplinearization]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.3, Theorem 13.13","source_printed_pages":"589","source_pdf_pages":"613","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pblplinearization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pblplinearization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pblplinearization — 符号敏感线性化的逐纤维精确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a60d76d37648fa4\" href=\"?note=0a60d76d37648fa4\" title=\"27-df-pblplinearization\">27-df-pblplinearization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.3, Theorem 13.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"589"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"613"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\">\\(P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)\">\\(f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_P,\\mathcal L(P)\">\\(F_P,\\mathcal L(P)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a60d76d37648fa4\" href=\"?note=0a60d76d37648fa4\" title=\"27-df-pblplinearization\">27-df-pblplinearization</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\)</span> 取其上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\max\\{F_P(x,y):y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,\\ (x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)\\}=f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\max\\{F_P(x,y):y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,\\ (x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)\\}=f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{(x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)}F_P(x,y)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{(x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)}F_P(x,y)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定x。若b_k&gt;0，全部文字为1时最优取y_k=1，否则某个上界为0，强制y_k=0。若b_k&lt;0，全部文字为1时下界为1，否则下界不大于0，最优取y_k=0。零系数任取。各y无耦合，逐项最大值恢复PBNF，每个纤维非空。原书证明的“每个最优解所有y都等于文字积”需排除零系数；这里的值相等断言无需该隐含条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pblplinearization","status":"resolved","id":"0a60d76d37648fa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pblplinearization]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pblplinearization","status":"resolved","id":"0a60d76d37648fa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$F_P,\\mathcal L(P)$ 见 [[27-df-pblplinearization]]，$\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$F_P,\\mathcal L(P)$ 见 [[27-df-pblplinearization]]，$\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)","display":false},{"tex":"F_P,\\mathcal L(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\max\\{F_P(x,y):y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,\\ (x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)\\}=f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{(x,y)\\in\\mathcal L(P)}F_P(x,y)=\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).","display":true}],"bytes":1537,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pblplinearization|thm-pblplinearization — 符号敏感线性化的逐纤维精确性]]"}],"outgoing":["0a60d76d37648fa4","34c60c3bc15859dd"]}